    "cli.rightSidebar.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux right-sidebar <command> [flags]\n\nControl the right sidebar from the CLI.\n\nCommands:\n  toggle                         Toggle right sidebar visibility\n  show                           Show the right sidebar\n  hide                           Hide the right sidebar\n  focus                          Focus the current right sidebar mode\n  set|set-mode <files|find|vault|sessions|feed|dock|source-control>\n                                 Show, switch mode, and focus\n  mode                           Print {\"visible\":bool,\"mode\":string}\n  files|find|vault|sessions|feed|dock|source-control\n                                 Alias for show + set|set-mode + focus\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>     Target the window containing a workspace\n  --window <id|ref|index>        Target a window\n  --no-focus                     With set, switch mode without moving focus\n\nExamples:\n  cmux right-sidebar toggle\n  cmux right-sidebar set find\n  cmux right-sidebar set vault --no-focus\n  cmux right-sidebar mode"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用法: cmux right-sidebar <command> [flags]\n\nCLI から右サイドバーを操作します。\n\nコマンド:\n  toggle                         右サイドバーの表示を切り替えます\n  show                           右サイドバーを表示します\n  hide                           右サイドバーを隠します\n  focus                          現在の右サイドバーモードにフォーカスします\n  set|set-mode <files|find|vault|sessions|feed|dock|source-control>\n                                 表示して、モードを切り替え、フォーカスします\n  mode                           {\"visible\":bool,\"mode\":string} を出力します\n  files|find|vault|sessions|feed|dock|source-control\n                                 show + set|set-mode + focus のエイリアス\n\nフラグ:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>     ワークスペースを含むウィンドウを対象にします\n  --window <id|ref|index>        ウィンドウを対象にします\n  --no-focus                     set で、フォーカスを移さずにモードだけ切り替えます\n\n例:\n  cmux right-sidebar toggle\n  cmux right-sidebar set find\n  cmux right-sidebar set vault --no-focus\n  cmux right-sidebar mode"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux right-sidebar <command> [flags]\n\nControl the right sidebar from the CLI.\n\nCommands:\n  toggle                         Toggle right sidebar visibility\n  show                           Show the right sidebar\n  hide                           Hide the right sidebar\n  focus                          Focus the current right sidebar mode\n  set|set-mode <files|find|vault|sessions|feed|dock|source-control>\n                                 Show, switch mode, and focus\n  mode                           Print {\"visible\":bool,\"mode\":string}\n  files|find|vault|sessions|feed|dock|source-control\n                                 Alias for show + set|set-mode + focus\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>     Target the window containing a workspace\n  --window <id|ref|index>        Target a window\n  --no-focus                     With set, switch mode without moving focus\n\nExamples:\n  cmux right-sidebar toggle\n  cmux right-sidebar set find\n  cmux right-sidebar set vault --no-focus\n  cmux right-sidebar mode"
          }
        },
        "bs": {
